      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_investment = 250000\n    ending_fund_value = 320000\n    management_fee_rate = 0.04\n    incentive_fee_rate = 0.12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    profit = ending_fund_value - initial_investment\n    management_fee = ending_fund_value * management_fee_rate\n    incentive_fee = profit * incentive_fee_rate\n    ending_investor_value = ending_fund_value - management_fee - incentive_fee\n    annual_return = ((ending_investor_value - initial_investment) / initial_investment) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(annual_return, 1)\n```",
